{
  "uid": "infraready-serveurs",
  "title": "InfraReady — Serveurs",
  "description": "Tableau de bord d'exploitation InfraReady (prise de poste) : disponibilité, uptime, CPU, mémoire, stockage, contrôle planifié du site web, maintenance Linux et alertes actives de WIN-DC01, LINUX01 et OPS01. Source : Prometheus (node_exporter, windows_exporter, collecteur textfile). Période par défaut : 6 dernières heures. Lecture : tout ce qui n'est pas vert, toute alerte active ou toute case « NON COLLECTÉ » justifie une investigation (contrôle de santé : ansible-playbook playbooks/controle_sante.yml).",
  "tags": ["infraready"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "host",
        "label": "Hôte",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=~\"linux|windows\"}, host)",
        "definition": "label_values(up{job=~\"linux|windows\"}, host)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["Tous"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilité des serveurs",
      "description": "Résultat du dernier scrape (up) par serveur : EN LIGNE = exporter joignable, HORS LIGNE = scrape en échec (alerte InstanceDown après 1 min), NON COLLECTÉ = aucune série (cible absente de la configuration Prometheus ou Prometheus arrêté). Décision : HORS LIGNE ou NON COLLECTÉ → vérifier la VM, le service exporter et le pare-feu.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (host) (up{job=~\"linux|windows\", host=~\"$host\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "NON COLLECTÉ",
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "HORS LIGNE", "color": "red", "index": 0 }, "1": { "text": "EN LIGNE", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "description": "Durée depuis le dernier démarrage (node_boot_time_seconds sous Linux, windows_system_boot_time_timestamp sous Windows), en jours/heures. Décision : une valeur courte inattendue signale un redémarrage non planifié → consulter le journal (Windows : événements 41 / 6008).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Linux",
          "expr": "time() - node_boot_time_seconds{host=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Windows",
          "expr": "time() - windows_system_boot_time_timestamp{host=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "NON COLLECTÉ",
          "unit": "s",
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU (%)",
      "description": "Utilisation CPU moyenne par serveur sur 2 min, en % (0-100 %). Seuils : orange 80 %, rouge 95 % (alerte CpuEleve > 80 % pendant 2 min). Un trou dans la courbe = pas de donnée collectée (serveur ou supervision arrêtés), pas un CPU à 0 %.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Linux",
          "expr": "100 - avg by (host) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\", host=~\"$host\"}[2m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "Windows",
          "expr": "100 - avg by (host) (rate(windows_cpu_time_total{mode=\"idle\", host=~\"$host\"}[2m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Aucune donnée",
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 80 }, { "color": "red", "value": 95 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire utilisée (%)",
      "description": "Mémoire utilisée par serveur, en % de la mémoire physique (MemAvailable sous Linux). Seuils : orange 80 %, rouge 90 % (alerte MemoireElevee > 90 % pendant 5 min). Un trou = absence de donnée.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Linux",
          "expr": "(1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{host=~\"$host\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "Windows",
          "expr": "(1 - windows_memory_available_bytes{host=~\"$host\"} / windows_memory_physical_total_bytes{host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Aucune donnée",
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 80 }, { "color": "red", "value": 90 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Stockage utilisé (%) par volume",
      "description": "Occupation actuelle de chaque volume, en % (ext4/xfs sous Linux, lettres de lecteur sous Windows). Seuils : orange 70 %, rouge 85 % (alerte DisquePresquePlein). Décision : au-delà de 85 %, identifier ce qui grossit avant toute maintenance (la maintenance Linux s'arrête au-delà de 85 %).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Linux",
          "expr": "(1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\", host=~\"$host\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\", host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{mountpoint}}",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Windows",
          "expr": "(1 - windows_logical_disk_free_bytes{volume=~\"[A-Z]:\", host=~\"$host\"} / windows_logical_disk_size_bytes{volume=~\"[A-Z]:\", host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{volume}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "namePlacement": "left"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "NON COLLECTÉ",
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 70 }, { "color": "red", "value": 85 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Alertes Prometheus actives",
      "description": "Alertes Prometheus à l'état « firing ». Tableau vide = aucune alerte active (valeur réellement nulle) ; ce panneau ne remplace pas le panneau Disponibilité si Prometheus lui-même est arrêté.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", host=~\"$host\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Value": true, "__name__": true, "job": true, "instance": true },
            "indexByName": { "alertname": 0, "severity": 1, "host": 2, "alertstate": 3 },
            "renameByName": { "alertname": "Alerte", "severity": "Sévérité", "host": "Hôte", "alertstate": "État" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "Aucune alerte active" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contrôle planifié du site web (LINUX01)",
      "description": "Résultat du timer infraready-controle-site (check-nginx.sh chaque minute, collecteur textfile) : OK / ÉCHEC, et âge du dernier contrôle en secondes. Décision : ÉCHEC → site indisponible pour les utilisateurs même si le serveur est EN LIGNE (alerte SiteWebIndisponible après 2 min) ; âge > 300 s → la tâche planifiée ne tourne plus (alerte ControlePlanifieEnRetard) ; NON COLLECTÉ → fichier de métriques absent.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Etat",
          "expr": "max by (host) (infraready_controle_succes{controle=\"site_web\", host=~\"$host\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} état",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Age",
          "expr": "time() - max by (host) (infraready_controle_derniere_execution_secondes{controle=\"site_web\", host=~\"$host\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} âge du dernier contrôle",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "noValue": "NON COLLECTÉ" },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "Etat" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "ÉCHEC", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}] }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "Age" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 120}, {"color": "red", "value": 300}]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Maintenance Linux (paquets et redémarrage)",
      "description": "Collecteur apt de node_exporter (mis à jour toutes les 15 min) : paquets à installer, paquets retenus (mises à jour progressives d'Ubuntu, non installées par « apt upgrade »), redémarrage requis. 0 = valeur réellement nulle (le collecteur a tourné) ; NON COLLECTÉ = collecteur absent. Décision : préparer une fenêtre de maintenance (docs/procedure-maintenance.md) si des paquets sont à installer ou si un redémarrage est requis.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "AInstaller",
          "expr": "sum by (host) (apt_upgrades_pending{host=~\"$host\"}) or sum by (host) (apt_upgrades_held{host=~\"$host\"}) * 0 or max by (host) (apt_autoremove_pending{host=~\"$host\"}) * 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} à installer",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Retenus",
          "expr": "sum by (host) (apt_upgrades_held{host=~\"$host\"}) or max by (host) (apt_autoremove_pending{host=~\"$host\"}) * 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} retenus",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "Reboot",
          "expr": "max by (host) (node_reboot_required{host=~\"$host\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} redémarrage requis",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "NON COLLECTÉ",
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 1}] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "Retenus" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}] }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "Reboot" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": { "text": "non", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                      "1": { "text": "OUI", "color": "orange", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stockage utilisé (%) — évolution",
      "description": "Historique de l'occupation de chaque volume, en % (seuil d'alerte 85 % en pointillé). Sert à distinguer une mesure ponctuelle d'une tendance (séance 6, UC-C3) : choisir une période longue (7 jours) ; les trous correspondent aux périodes où le labo était éteint (aucune donnée, pas une occupation nulle).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-infraready" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "Linux",
          "expr": "(1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\", host=~\"$host\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\", host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{mountpoint}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "Windows",
          "expr": "(1 - windows_logical_disk_free_bytes{volume=~\"[A-Z]:\", host=~\"$host\"} / windows_logical_disk_size_bytes{volume=~\"[A-Z]:\", host=~\"$host\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{volume}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "Aucune donnée",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 85}] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["min", "max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
